Mike Galbraith said:
> On Wed, 2009-02-18 at 14:00 +0800, Shan Wei wrote:
> 
>> In sysbench(version:sysbench-0.4.10), I confirmed followings.
>>   - CFQ's performance is worse than other IO schedulers when only multiple
